skuekin edo ukitu adreilu bat norabide bat aukeratzeko.","Lesson 2: Eating & Growing":"2 ikasgaia: Jan eta hazi","Eat 3 berries. Every berry makes you longer and adds to your score.":"Jan 3 ahabiak. Bailarak luzeago egiten zaitu eta zure puntuazioa handitzen du.","Lesson 3: Danger":"Lezio 3: Arriskua","Walls, stones, and your own body are lethal. Survive 40 ticks while growing to length 6.":"Hormak, harriak eta zure gorputza hilgarriak dira. Bizirik iraun 40 karramarroek 6 luzera arte hazi bitartean.","Lesson 4: Hunting Rivals":"4. ikasgaia: Arerioak ehizatzea","Small golden rivals are prey. Catch one with your head to defeat it.":"Arerio txikiak harrapakinak dira. Buruarekin harrapatu eta garaitu.","Lesson 5: Bigger Threats":"5. ikasgaia: Mehatxu handiagoak","Large dark rivals hunt YOU. Any touch is fatal. Survive 60 ticks.":"Arerio ilun handiek ehizatzen zaituzte. Ukitze bat hilgarria da. Bizirik iraun 60 karramarro.","Counted Steps":"Zenbatutako Urratsak","Finish 8 berries within 90 moves.":"Amaitu 8 ahabi 90 mugimendutan.","Tailwind":"Atzeko haizea.","High speed: eat 10 berries.":"Abiadura handikoak: 10 ahabi jan.","Hedgemaze":"Erregetxo","A dense garden cross. Reach length 12.":"Lorategiko gurutze trinkoa. Helmen-luzera 12","Rival Rush":"Errebeldeen lasterketa","Defeat 4 small rivals while a big one prowls.":"4 etsai txiki garaitu, handi bat inguruan dabilenean.","Golden Only":"Urrezkoa bakarrik.","Score 400 with golden berries everywhere.":"400 puntu, urrezko fruituekin.","The Gauntlet":"Gauntlet","Survive 300 ticks with two hunters.":"Bizirik irautea 300 karramarroekin bi ehiztariekin.","Relaxed":"Lasai","Steady":"Etengabe","Brisk":"Bizkorra.","Fierce":"Sutsu","The round is already over.":"Bukatu da jada txanda.","Unknown direction.":"Norabide ezezaguna.","The serpent cannot reverse into itself.":"Sugeak ezin du bere buruaren atzera egin.","Command is not an object.":"Agintea ez da objektu bat.","Unknown command type.":"Agindu mota ezezaguna.","Low thud — serpent down":"— sugearen kolpe baxuak.","Guest Gardener":"Lorezain gonbidatua.","Bramble":"Marrubiak","Moss":"Muskerra","Thistle":"Arantza.","{name} (spirit)":"{name} (likorea)","That move is not legal.":"Mugimendu hori ez da legezkoa.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Aurrerapena leheneratu da zure StarHermit hodeiko gordetzetik.","Close panel":"Itxi panela","Close":"Itxi","Angled garden view":"Lorategiko ikuspegia angeluan","Top-down view":"Goitik behera","Sound, graphics, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"Soinua, grafikoak, hizkuntza, testu handiagoa, kontraste handia eta mugimendu murriztua StarHermit Aukeretan daude.","Open Options":"Ireki Aukerak","Key bindings":"Tekla-loturak","Graphics":"Grafikoak","Camera view":"Kameraren ikuspegia"}
